#: ../../tools/unichem_tools.rst:32 294187706742462eace0bd6b2ff82d27
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all chemical database sources registered in "
"UniChem. Returns the complete catalog of 40+ databases with their source "
"IDs, names, descriptions, compound counts, and URLs. Use this to discover"
" which databases are available for cross-referencing and to find source "
"IDs for the UniChem\\_search\\_compound tool. Major sources include "
"ChEMBL (id=1), DrugBank (id=2), PDBe (id=3), PubChem (id=22), KEGG "
"(id=6), ChEBI (id=7), HMDB (id=18)."
msgstr ""

